{"id":"62ea7cd84f64e253","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-analysis2-uniform-space.md","title":"ZFC Analysis2 Uniform Space","display":"df-zfc-analysis2-uniform-space — ZFC Analysis2 Uniform Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-analysis2-uniform-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-analysis2-uniform-space"],"display":"df-zfc-analysis2-uniform-space — ZFC Analysis2 Uniform Space","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-identity.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-set12-relation-composition.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-inverse-relation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-analysis2-uniform-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-analysis2-uniform-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-analysis2-uniform-space — ZFC Analysis2 Uniform Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f96ea0698fd88ab2\" href=\"?note=f96ea0698fd88ab2\" title=\"58-df-identity.md\">58-df-identity.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"33d499f681d88614\" href=\"?note=33d499f681d88614\" title=\"58-df-zfc-set12-relation-composition.md\">58-df-zfc-set12-relation-composition.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f153d56390f34389\" href=\"?note=f153d56390f34389\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-inverse-relation.md\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-inverse-relation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal U\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal U\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Id}_X\">\\(\\operatorname{Id}_X\\)</span> (恒等关系, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f96ea0698fd88ab2\" href=\"?note=f96ea0698fd88ab2\" title=\"58-df-identity.md\">58-df-identity.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12RelationComposition}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet12RelationComposition}_S\\)</span> (关系复合图谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"33d499f681d88614\" href=\"?note=33d499f681d88614\" title=\"58-df-zfc-set12-relation-composition.md\">58-df-zfc-set12-relation-composition.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InverseRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{InverseRelation}_S\\)</span> (逆关系图谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f153d56390f34389\" href=\"?note=f153d56390f34389\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-inverse-relation.md\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-inverse-relation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2UniformSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2UniformSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}analysis2\\text{-}uniform\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2UniformSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X\\times X)\\land\\varnothing\\notin\\mathcal U\n\\land X\\times X\\in\\mathcal U\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall U,V\\in\\mathcal U\\;(U\\cap V\\in\\mathcal U)\n\\land\\forall U\\in\\mathcal U\\;\\forall W\\subseteq X\\times X\\;(U\\subseteq W\\to W\\in\\mathcal U)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall U\\in\\mathcal U\\;(\\operatorname{Id}_X\\subseteq U)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall U\\in\\mathcal U\\;\\exists V\\in\\mathcal U\\;\\exists V^{\\smile}\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{InverseRelation}_S(V^{\\smile},V,X,X)\\land V^{\\smile}\\subseteq U\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall U\\in\\mathcal U\\;\\exists V\\in\\mathcal U\\;\\exists C\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet12RelationComposition}_S(C,V,V)\\land C\\subseteq U\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}analysis2\\text{-}uniform\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2UniformSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X\\times X)\\land\\varnothing\\notin\\mathcal U\n\\land X\\times X\\in\\mathcal U\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall U,V\\in\\mathcal U\\;(U\\cap V\\in\\mathcal U)\n\\land\\forall U\\in\\mathcal U\\;\\forall W\\subseteq X\\times X\\;(U\\subseteq W\\to W\\in\\mathcal U)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall U\\in\\mathcal U\\;(\\operatorname{Id}_X\\subseteq U)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall U\\in\\mathcal U\\;\\exists V\\in\\mathcal U\\;\\exists V^{\\smile}\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{InverseRelation}_S(V^{\\smile},V,X,X)\\land V^{\\smile}\\subseteq U\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall U\\in\\mathcal U\\;\\exists V\\in\\mathcal U\\;\\exists C\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet12RelationComposition}_S(C,V,V)\\land C\\subseteq U\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The filter axioms are expanded on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(X\\times X)\">\\(\\mathcal P(X\\times X)\\)</span>; the former two-argument <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Filter}\">\\(\\operatorname{Filter}\\)</span> call did not match the ordered-set filter predicate in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"58-df-filter\">58-df-filter</a>.</li>\n<li>The remaining clauses are the diagonal, inverse, and square-refinement axioms for a uniformity. 恒等、逆关系与复合均调用书内精确图谓词，不再把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_X,V^{-1},V\\circ V\">\\(\\Delta_X,V^{-1},V\\circ V\\)</span> 当作无来源运算。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-identity.md","status":"resolved","id":"f96ea0698fd88ab2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-identity.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-set12-relation-composition.md","status":"resolved","id":"33d499f681d88614","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-set12-relation-composition.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-zfc-inverse-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"f153d56390f34389","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-inverse-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-identity.md","status":"resolved","id":"f96ea0698fd88ab2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Id}_X$ (恒等关系, see [[58-df-identity.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-set12-relation-composition.md","status":"resolved","id":"33d499f681d88614","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcSet12RelationComposition}_S$ (关系复合图谓词, see [[58-df-zfc-set12-relation-composition.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-zfc-inverse-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"f153d56390f34389","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{InverseRelation}_S$ (逆关系图谓词, see [[../batch20/58-df-zfc-inverse-relation.md